Tammy
Copyright 2026 Nick Wisehart

Tammy is a Slack agent that answers customers from a product's documentation
and takes their problem reports to Prepcook
(https://github.com/nwisehart/prepcook). It talks to Prepcook only through
Prepcook's documented card API and webhook notifications, and contains no
Prepcook code.

